7	MixedȾCase	mixedⱦcase	MIXEDȾCASE
8	aaaⱦbbb	aaaⱦbbb	AAAȾBBB
9	ⱦ	ⱦ	Ⱦ
10	ⱦxxxⱦ	ⱦxxxⱦ	ȾXXXȾ
12	ⱦⱦⱦⱦ	ⱦⱦⱦⱦ	ȾȾȾȾ
13	Mixedⱦcase	mixedⱦcase	MIXEDȾCASE
SELECT * FROM test_view WHERE lowered IN ('aaaⱦbbb', 'ⱦ') ORDER BY id;
